@startuml Notizen OAuth Flow with PKCE

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

autonumber

actor User
participant "WebView" as WV
participant "Custom Tab" as CT
participant "Server" as S
participant "GAIA" as GA

== PKCE Setup ==

User -> WV: Tap "Sign in with Google"
WV -> WV: WebView intercepts navigation to GAIA
WV -> WV: Generate code_verifier,\ncompute code_challenge = SHA256(code_verifier)
WV -> CT: Open Custom Tab to\nhttps://notizen.dev/android-signin?code_challenge=xxx

== Google OAuth ==

CT -> S: GET /android-signin?code_challenge=xxx
S -> CT: 302 Redirect with Google OAuth URL
CT -> GA: Navigate to Google sign-in
GA -> User: Show account picker
User -> GA: Select account & consent
GA -> CT: 302 Redirect to\n/api/auth/callback/google?code=<google_authorization_code>
CT -> S: GET /api/auth/callback/google?code=xyz
S -> GA: Exchange Google authorization code for Google tokens\n(access token, refresh token, ID token)
GA -> S: Return tokens
S -> S: Save Google tokens to DB,\nissue native JWT to create a session
S -> CT: 302 Redirect to /api/android-callback?code_challenge=xxx\n+ Set-Cookie: session_token
CT -> CT: Store session cookie

== One-Time Code Generation ==

CT -> S: GET /api/android-callback?code_challenge=xxx\n(JWT attached)
S -> S: Validate session,\ngenerate one-time code (OTC),\nstore OTC + code_challenge in DB

== Deep Link Handoff ==

S -> CT: 302 Redirect to intent://auth?otc=abc#Intent;\nscheme=notizen;package=com.google.android.samples.notizen;end
CT -> WV: Android delivers intent to specified package only,\nCustom Tab closes

== Token Exchange ==

WV -> S: POST /api/exchange\n{ otc: "abc", code_verifier: "xxx" }
S -> S: Verify: SHA256(code_verifier) == stored code_challenge\nDelete one-time code (single use)

alt Valid code_verifier
  S -> WV: 200 OK + Set-Cookie: JWT
  WV -> WV: Authenticated — load /notes
else Invalid code_verifier
  S -> WV: 401 Unauthorized
end

@enduml
